{{template "header" .}}

<div class="page">
  <!-- Hero -->
  <div class="mx-auto max-w-2xl text-center">
    <img src="/assets/icons/pocket.png" alt="" class="mx-auto mb-6 size-14">
    <h1 class="display text-ink">Moving from Pocket to Pensive</h1>
    <p class="lede mx-auto mt-4 max-w-xl">Your Pocket data deserves a better home. Let's build what a great Pocket could have been.</p>
  </div>

  <!-- Story -->
  <section class="card mx-auto mt-14 max-w-3xl p-6 sm:p-10">
    <h2 class="headline-md text-ink">A personal story</h2>
    <div class="mt-5 flex flex-col items-center gap-6 md:flex-row md:items-start">
      <div class="prose-archive prose-compact flex-1">
        <p>I was using Pocket for a long time. I loved it. It was clean and nice. I even received the message to celebrate being one of the top 5%.</p>
        <p>Although it was not perfect. I was always struggling with the search. It was just not good. It seemed Pocket was never designed for search.</p>
        <p>But not only did it not get better, it got even worse and worse. Mozilla decided to turn this beautiful nice app into an ad board. I saw no positive development, and now it's shutdown.</p>
        <p><strong>That gave me a reason to start Pensive. And now you can too.</strong></p>
      </div>
      <img src="/assets/images/pocket-reader.webp" alt="Pocket reader" class="w-56 shrink-0 rounded-xl border border-line shadow-soft">
    </div>
    <p class="mt-6 border-t border-line pt-6 font-serif text-xl text-ink italic">
      Let's make this app what a great Pocket could have been, built for the age of AI.
    </p>
  </section>

  <!-- Features -->
  <div class="mx-auto mt-12 grid max-w-3xl gap-4 sm:grid-cols-2">
    <div class="card p-6">
      <h3 class="title">Powerful search</h3>
      <p class="mt-1 text-ink-muted">Built from the ground up with search in mind. Find your articles instantly with intelligent search that actually works.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="card p-6">
      <h3 class="title">AI-powered</h3>
      <p class="mt-1 text-ink-muted">Designed for the age of AI with smart categorization, content extraction, and intelligent organization.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="card p-6">
      <h3 class="title">Privacy first</h3>
      <p class="mt-1 text-ink-muted">Your data stays yours. No ads, no tracking, no selling your reading habits to advertisers.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="card p-6">
      <h3 class="title">Easy migration</h3>
      <p class="mt-1 text-ink-muted">Import your Pocket data with just a few clicks. All your articles, tags, and metadata preserved.</p>
    </div>
  </div>

  <!-- Steps -->
  <section class="mx-auto mt-14 max-w-3xl">
    <h2 class="headline-md text-center text-ink">How to migrate</h2>
    <div class="mt-8 grid gap-6 sm:grid-cols-3">
      <div class="text-center">
        <span class="mx-auto mb-3 flex size-10 items-center justify-center rounded-full bg-clay-wash font-serif text-lg font-bold text-clay">1</span>
        <h4 class="title">Export from Pocket</h4>
        <p class="mt-1 text-sm text-ink-muted">Visit getpocket.com/export and download your data.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="text-center">
        <span class="mx-auto mb-3 flex size-10 items-center justify-center rounded-full bg-clay-wash font-serif text-lg font-bold text-clay">2</span>
        {{if currentUser}}
          <h4 class="title">Open the importer</h4>
          <p class="mt-1 text-sm text-ink-muted">You're signed in, so head straight to the import page.</p>
        {{else}}
          <h4 class="title">Create an account</h4>
          <p class="mt-1 text-sm text-ink-muted">Sign up for free to reach the import page.</p>
        {{end}}
      </div>
      <div class="text-center">
        <span class="mx-auto mb-3 flex size-10 items-center justify-center rounded-full bg-clay-wash font-serif text-lg font-bold text-clay">3</span>
        <h4 class="title">Upload & relax</h4>
        <p class="mt-1 text-sm text-ink-muted">Upload the ZIP file and we'll handle the rest.</p>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="mt-10 flex flex-col justify-center gap-3 sm:flex-row">
      {{if currentUser}}
        <a href="/users/pocket-import" class="btn btn-primary">Start import</a>
        <a href="/home" class="btn btn-secondary">Go to library</a>
      {{else}}
        <a href="/signup" class="btn btn-primary">Get started free</a>
        <a href="/signin" class="btn btn-secondary">Sign in</a>
      {{end}}
    </div>
  </section>
</div>

{{template "footer" .}}
